    {
      "label": "Description",
      "value": [
        "This spell grants the following:",
        "You attempt to endure any attack or effect. When you cast this spell, chose one attack type and one side effect; you are now resistant to them.",
        "If an attack hits you, you may either block 1d8 damage or condone the enemy to 1d8 damage in the form of force.",
        "You gain an extra 2 AC.",
        "If you are carrying any armor or shields, all negative effects disappear.",
        "This spell lasts 2 minutes longer per level on the spell slot you use to cast the spell.",
        "* - (Any piece of metal worth 5 GP)"
      ],
